1
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,140
Young Madam.

2
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:41,900
How dare you!

3
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,000
Just wait.

4
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,940
I'll go report to the Madam.

5
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,160
Thank you, Young Madam.

6
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:51,780
Xue.

7
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:53,500
It's okay.

8
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:08,440
Ms. Ling

9
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,760
copied these for you.

10
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,700
Copy some more,

11
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,320
and put them inside.

12
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:12,300
No one will notice.

13
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,100
Xueqiu,

14
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:15,500
you're really a good girl.

15
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:19,080
Miss Xueqiu seems to go out a lot lately.

16
00:01:19,940 --> 00:01:21,400
Have you ever been in love?

17
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,520
What

18
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:23,660
is love?

19
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:25,800
It's

20
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:27,620
dating a man.

21
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:29,680
No.

22
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,640
Men

23
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:40,080
are not good.

24
00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:50,080
Xueqiu

25
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,580
Qingyou, help me.

26
00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:55,420
I don't want to marry Ye Wenbo.

27
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:56,960
My grandma insists on marrying me to him.

28
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:58,680
That playboy, in order to marry into our family,

29
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,940
regardless of his daughter's young age,

30
00:01:59,940 --> 00:02:01,800
beat his wife to death.

31
00:02:02,460 --> 00:02:04,460
My grandma is pushing me into the fire.

32
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:05,640
They

33
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,280
They are coming soon.

34
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:13,540
Let's hide here.

35
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,140
Why are there so many people?

36
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,840
Did you hide Xueqiu?

37
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,220
Where did you hide her?

38
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,360
Grandma,

39
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,420
the floor is old and unattended,

40
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,700
so it makes noise.

41
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:18,260
I have important matters to deal with,

42
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,740
so I'll leave you alone.

43
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:20,620
Please.

44
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:22,140
Let's go.

45
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:36,900
Xueqiu.

46
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:37,620
Xueqiu.

47
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:40,980
Qingyou.

48
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:41,820
It's okay.

49
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:44,760
Your brother

50
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,880
loves you.

51
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:50,880
Qingyou, save me.

52
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:53,740
Young Marshal, you came back.

53
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,740
Is it because he's afraid that I'll take Xueqiu away

54
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:57,380
and ruin the marriage between Ye and Ling families?

55
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,820
The Ye family's young master is a bit frivolous,

56
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,540
but as long as I'm here,

57
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:02,900
he won't hurt Xueqiu.

58
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,500
Moreover, this matter

59
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:05,800
concerns the business of the Ling family,

60
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:07,340
it's not a trivial matter.

61
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,060
Using your sister's marriage

62
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:11,100
to exchange for business,

63
00:04:11,340 --> 00:04:13,180
you're really a decent Young Marshal.

64
00:04:13,460 --> 00:04:14,760
If you really want to protect her,

65
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,020
you should break off the engagement,

66
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:18,000
instead of pushing her into a pit of fire.

67
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:19,400
Don't provoke me, my lady.

68
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:21,140
This is the business of the Ling family.

69
00:04:21,340 --> 00:04:22,740
It's not your turn to interfere.

70
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,100
Xueqiu,

71
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,900
I don't want to marry that playboy of the Ye family.

72
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,080
If you want to marry,

73
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,280
then marry my dead body.

74
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:32,540
Nonsense!

75
00:04:33,300 --> 00:04:34,780
Punishing yourself for someone else's mistake,

76
00:04:34,780 --> 00:04:35,740
what kind of sense does that make?

77
00:04:35,740 --> 00:04:36,640
Qingming,

78
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,280
I...

79
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:40,180
I'll go find Huai.

80
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:42,360
I'll elope with him.

81
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:43,060
I...

82
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:46,160
I'll beat the love-struck out of you!

83
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,160
Your engagement is known to all.

84
00:04:48,540 --> 00:04:50,500
If he really cares about you,

85
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:51,800
he would've done something.

86
00:04:52,380 --> 00:04:54,240
How can you

87
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,020
settle for being a concubine

88
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,380
when you're the head of the Ling family?

89
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,000
Enough!

90
00:04:58,580 --> 00:04:59,120
Give me the gun.

91
00:05:05,780 --> 00:05:06,420
You'll reflect

92
00:05:07,300 --> 00:05:09,140
in the ancestral hall today.

93
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:11,340
You have two days to decide

94
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:13,200
if you'll accept this marriage

95
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:14,620
or

96
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:16,100
I'll announce to the public

97
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:18,060
that Miss Ling is disobedient

98
00:05:18,180 --> 00:05:18,800
and will never get married,

99
00:05:18,820 --> 00:05:19,980
and end the Ye family's hope.

100
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:28,100
Lock the door.

101
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:28,600
Yes.

102
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:33,820
Brother,

103
00:06:03,780 --> 00:06:05,160
someone's coming.

104
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,880
Miss, this is your lunch.

105
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:20,240
OK.

106
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,760
I'll take you out.

107
00:06:30,460 --> 00:06:30,880
Come on.

108
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:38,540
Xueqiu.

109
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:39,720
You got out of here.

110
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,040
The rest of the way,

111
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:43,260
you have to go by yourself.

112
00:06:43,260 --> 00:06:44,060
Your Highness.

113
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,680
I can't repay

114
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,060
your great kindness.

115
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,440
Xueqiu...

116
00:06:49,540 --> 00:06:51,240
I can only repay it in the next life.

117
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,720
What are you talking about?

118
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,060
Before they find us,

119
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:56,660
hurry up.

120
00:06:56,660 --> 00:06:57,560
Run that way.

121
00:06:57,900 --> 00:06:58,420
Hurry up.

122
00:06:58,440 --> 00:06:59,020
Hurry up.

123
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,300
You, Su Muwan,

124
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,660
you must be the one who hit my head.

125
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:15,840
Last time, you hit my head,

126
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:17,680
and you stopped Ling Xueqiu from marrying me.

127
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:42,160
Are you okay?

128
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,480
How dare you ruin my good thing.

129
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:53,460
Watch out!

130
00:08:03,020 --> 00:08:04,060
Su Muwan.

131
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:05,360
Su Muwan.

132
00:08:16,940 --> 00:08:17,420
Doctor,

133
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,400
how is she?

134
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:20,240
Her wound has turned black.

135
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:22,460
The dagger must be poisoned.

136
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:23,360
The poison

137
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,120
is very strong.

138
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,860
So the most important thing now

139
00:08:25,860 --> 00:08:27,100
is to detoxify her body

140
00:08:27,100 --> 00:08:28,080
first.

141
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:48,840
You're awake.

142
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:58,640
The fever is gone.

143
00:09:01,260 --> 00:09:02,140
Xueqiu...

144
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:03,820
Is she...

145
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:04,700
Don't worry.

146
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,640
No one can force my sister

147
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:08,120
into marriage.

148
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,760
You've been here all along?

149
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:16,600
Yes.

150
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:21,540
Don't

151
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,840
do anything like that again.

152
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:26,960
What do you mean?

153
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:29,480
Blocking a knife?

154
00:09:30,340 --> 00:09:32,140
It's the stupidest thing.

155
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,640
If it happens again,

156
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,560
I'll do the same.

157
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:45,440
Take a nap.

158
00:09:46,180 --> 00:09:47,340
You're still weak.

159
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,420
I can only sleep soundly

160
00:10:04,060 --> 00:10:05,480
when you're here.

161
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,360
I disagree with this marriage.
